3z0bwMCdiRIRf_oZA&oe=6ABA8C4C"}, {"file_name": "com.tienminh.bowlingvr-20260311-104738.png", "id": "1411880310146369", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_1411880313479702_6432340890213472967_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qyc0Qbati1wQ7kNvwHLdmzZ&_nc_oc=Adrg8yuNnbdLi9oVzRZfbCbsBgqS5Ko5y8KXoTz9UMgAObBT22Ttd7zd-AnP1MHocxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLow4eYwuWfPzNSLuq_1Rd-StVjlewBhMUOSKSbW5x7ug&oe=6ABA6B6F"}, {"file_name": "com.tienminh.bowlingvr-20260311-104701.png", "id": "760270516916745", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_760270520250078_2791744893893845469_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZWMuw_WaMwQ7kNvwEb3XJY&_nc_oc=AdpBzqjkDzVTveMZLE3r6vYw1Vt5syushVIw2-cTHHStthsAhihhfZAdPRWOSrh9I8I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhoJIVO2JvCBXMSvTTt-uCfjnUtLPAZERrifrdoOxKhw&oe=6ABA671D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bowling VR", "keywords": ["bowling", "sports", "simulation", "arcade", "free"], "long_description": "Step into the lanes with Bowling VR \u2014 the ultimate virtual reality bowling experience for Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83c\udfb3 NINE GAME MODES\n\u2022 Classic Mode: Full 10-frame game with standard scoring. Chase the perfect 300!\n\u2022 Challenge Mode: Increasingly difficult pin arrangements \u2014 splits, washouts & more\n\u2022 Speed Bowl: Race against the clock for maximum pins\n\u2022 Practice Mode: Free throw with no pressure\n\u2022 Tournament: Pay coins to enter, compete against simulated opponents for prizes\n\u2022 Extreme Mode: Moving pins and obstacles \u2014 2x coin rewards\n\u2022 Career Mode: Progress through ranks from Rookie to Legend\n\u2022 Trick Shot: Hit specific pin targets for bonus coins\n\u2022 Spare Challenge: Clear tough spare setups to earn rewards\n\n\ud83c\udfd0 NINE PREMIUM BALLS\nCollect and unlock: Fire Ball, Ice Ball, Galaxy Ball, Gold Ball, Rainbow Ball, Plasma Ball, Inferno Ball, Thunder Ball & Cosmic Ball \u2014 each with unique visual effects\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 NINE LANE THEMES\nCustomize your alley: Neon Glow, Space Station, Underwater, Retro Arcade, Lava Flow, Frozen Ice, Jungle, Sunset & Midnight\n\n\ud83c\udf1f BALL TRAILS & STRIKE EFFECTS\n\u2022 Fire, Lightning & Galaxy ball trails\n\u2022 Fireworks, Confetti, Lightning & Neon Blast strike celebrations\n\n\ud83d\udca5 POWER-UPS\n\u2022 Guide Line: See your ball path before throwing\n\u2022 Slow Motion: Time slows for precise aim\n\u2022 Pin Magnet: Pins attract toward each other on impact\n\u2022 Second Chance: Re-throw on a bad roll\n\n\u26a1 KEY FEATURES\n\u2022 Realistic pin physics with satisfying knockdowns\n\u2022 Daily challenges & weekly rotating challenges with coin r", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfb3 The #1 FREE bowling game on Meta Quest! Bowl strikes with realistic physics across 9 unique game modes. Unlock 9 premium balls with stunning visual effects, customize 9 lane themes, and compete in daily challenges. Features: Career Mode, Tournament, Speed Bowl, Trick Shots, Power-Ups & more. Collect coins, spin the Lucky Wheel, and progress from Rookie to Legend. No hidden costs \u2014 completely free VR bowling with satisfying pin physics!"}]}, "developer_name": "NVR Labs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bowling-vr-privacy.pages.dev/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bowling-vr-website.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recomme