-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFPxQ3lUhV69Zm7A9E6DeicZvARvBvu68ETBbieuhwEQ&oe=6ABA8299"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bowling VR", "keywords": ["bowling", "sports", "pins", "strike", "arcade"], "long_description": "Step into the lanes with Bowling VR \u2014 the ultimate virtual reality bowling experience for Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83c\udfb3 THREE GAME MODES\n\u2022 Classic Mode: Full 10-frame game with standard scoring. Chase the perfect 300!\n\u2022 Challenge Mode: Test your skills against increasingly difficult pin arrangements\n\u2022 Practice Mode: Free throw with no pressure \u2014 perfect your technique\n\n\ud83c\udfd0 FOUR UNIQUE BALLS\n\u2022 Starter: Balanced and forgiving for beginners\n\u2022 Hook: Curves into the pocket for consistent strikes\n\u2022 Power: Heavy and devastating with maximum pin action\n\u2022 Speed: Lightweight and fast for aggressive plays\n\n\u26a1 KEY FEATURES\n\u2022 Realistic pin physics with satisfying knockdowns\n\u2022 Multiple difficulty levels (Easy, Medium, Hard)\n\u2022 Local leaderboard to track your best scores\n\u2022 Haptic feedback on ball release and pin impact\n\u2022 Beautiful open bowling lounge environment\n\u2022 Foul line and gutter detection\n\u2022 Detailed scorecard with frame-by-frame tracking\n\n\ud83c\udfae DESIGNED FOR COMFORT\n\u2022 Play standing or sitting\n\u2022 No artificial locomotion\n\u2022 Comfortable for all sessions\n\nNo internet required. No data collection. No ads. Just pure bowling fun.\n\nFree to play. Roll your first strike today!", "short_description": "Roll strikes in immersive VR! 3 game modes, 4 ball types, realistic pin physics. Free bowling fun on Meta Quest \u2014 no internet needed."}]}, "developer_name": "NVR Labs", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bowling-vr-privacy.pages.dev/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bowling-vr-website.page